---
name: is-mobile
type: registry:hook
title: Is Mobile
description: Reactive viewport breakpoint detection using Svelte’s MediaQuery.
files:
  - path: registry/items/utilities/is-mobile/is-mobile.svelte.ts
    type: registry:hook
    target: "~/hooks/is-mobile.svelte.ts"
---

Create the hook during component initialization. Read `current` to react to viewport changes. The default mobile breakpoint is 768px; pass a custom breakpoint to override it. During server rendering, `current` is false.

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import { IsMobile } from "~/hooks/is-mobile.svelte.js";
  const mobile = new IsMobile();
</script>

<p>{mobile.current ? "Mobile layout" : "Desktop layout"}</p>
```
